    "whatItIs": "FireHydrant is an incident-response and command platform (declare, coordinate, retrospective) with responder-priced packaging. Free covers up to 10 responders. Pro is $25/responder/month billed annually. Enterprise custom. 14-day Pro trial. Same incident-oncall cluster as PagerDuty — PagerDuty remains the award (8.0); this entity does not outrank it. Distinct from Rootly’s $20 Incident Response / On-Call Essentials split and from Datadog/Honeycomb observability.",
